WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.088
Why start here?

2
00:00:01.088 --> 00:00:04.537
Global Secure Access is
three things under one name.

3
00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:09.574
The Microsoft traffic profile comes
with Entra I D P one or P two.

4
00:00:09.574 --> 00:00:13.308
Internet Access and Private
Access are licensed separately,

5
00:00:13.308 --> 00:00:15.650
or come with the Microsoft Entra Suite.

6
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:20.500
Each has its own gate, so the decision is
made per function, not for the product.

7
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.678
And because nothing should block before
there is a record of what it blocked,

8
00:00:24.678 --> 00:00:27.662
the network logs go on before
the first pilot user does.

9
00:00:27.662 --> 00:00:31.576
Every later Validate step in
this path reads those logs.

10
00:00:31.576 --> 00:00:36.195
So in this module you decide each function,
write the architecture down for your

11
00:00:36.195 --> 00:00:40.730
tenant, take the first hashed configuration
export, and turn on the telemetry.
